===Noun===
{{en-noun|cozies}}

# A padded or [[knit]] covering to keep an item warm, especially a teapot or egg.
# A padded or knit covering for any item (often an electronic device such as a laptop computer).
# A work of [[crime]] [[fiction]] in which [[sex]] and [[violence]] are [[downplay]]ed or treated humorously, and the crime and detection take place in a small, socially intimate community.

====Derived terms====
